WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.020
A winter afternoon, and
the first flakes of snow.

2
00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:08.360
A stranger, on foot,
reaches a lonely farmhouse.

3
00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:12.390
He sleeps in a panelled box
bed, and dreams of a window,

4
00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:14.780
a branch, a hand.

5
00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:19.930
By the fire, a housekeeper starts the
story from about thirty years earlier.

6
00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:22.060
Two passionate lovers.

7
00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:25.610
So why hand their story to
a stranger and a servant?

8
00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:29.270
In this mission, you'll
open a story inside a story,

9
00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:32.460
a diary that begins: "1801.

10
00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:35.480
I have just returned from
a visit to my landlord".

11
00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:37.850
You'll see why the novel
starts near the end,

12
00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:39.500
then goes back.

13
00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:43.840
And you'll ask what each narrator
knows, and what each one misses.

14
00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:48.200
Your mission: explain why a
stranger and a servant tell it.
